Third-party attribution

This repository interoperates with and distributes independent lookups using
ip2region by lionsoul2014 and contributors:
https://github.com/lionsoul2014/ip2region

ip2region is dual-licensed under Apache-2.0 OR MIT. Its original licensing
terms are available at:
https://github.com/lionsoul2014/ip2region/blob/master/LICENSE.md

The upstream XDB files are downloaded directly from the official repository
into a private R2 bucket during synchronization. The XDB binaries are not
committed to this repository.
